<title>CHINA: ABN Amro HK branch places HK$200 mln CD.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro HK branch places HK$200 mln CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN Amro Bank's Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$200 million fixed rate certificate of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA) Central Moneymarkets Unit, the HKMA said.</p>
<p>The 6.65 percent certificates due March 9, 2000, were issued at par, and the deal was arranged by ABN Amro Bank's Hong Kong branch. The payment date is July 9.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
